name    mod-dungeon-challenge: item rewards, combat time per boss and the Enrage affix
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. Mythic+ ideas 7, 8 and 6 (Enrage), in FL: Akleia (747, one boss,
# single difficulty) at level 10.
#   6. week 3001 = Enrage + Lightning Sphere; a forced Enrage (55285) lands on Scaleburn (81332) once it fights.
#   8. the director hits Scaleburn (`.damage`), waits about 3 s and kills him (`.die`): the run's last boss reads
#      "fight 0:03" (0:02-0:04 with the update ticks).
#   7. the clear pays the level band 10-19: 2 Emblems of Frost (49426), doubled in time = 4 for bot a.
timeout 180s

bot a warrior
group party

place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
require a alive
do a destroy 49426
expect a item 49426 == 0

as gm .dchallenge week 3001
expect output has "Enrage"
as gm .dchallenge start 747 10
waitfor gm map 747 timeout 20s
waitfor a map 747 timeout 20s
wait 2s
as gm .dchallenge status
expect output has "level 10"
expect output has "Enrage"

log 6 - forced Enrage on the boss in combat
as gm .cheat god on
pick boss creature:81332 near gm
require boss exists
do gm target boss
as gm .damage 1000
waitfor boss incombat timeout 5s
as gm .dchallenge force 13
waitfor boss aura 55285 timeout 5s

log 8 - combat time of the boss
wait 2s
as gm .die
waitfor boss dead timeout 5s
wait 1s
as gm .dchallenge status
expect output has "Last boss: Scaleburn - fight 0:0"

log 7 - the level band's item reward, doubled in time
expect a item 49426 == 4

cleanup
as gm .cheat god off
as gm .dchallenge week 0
place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
do a destroy 49426
